retary of State for Multiculturalism</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sobal</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Frongillo</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acculturation and health of Korean Americans</article-title><source>Soc Sc Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>159</fpage><lpage>173</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10832565</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0277-9536(99)00446-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Van Teijlingen</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Hundley</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The importance of pilot studies</article-title><source>Soc Res Update</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Guildford: University of Surrey</publisher-name><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://sru.soc.surrey.ac.uk/SRU35.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Redfield</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Linton</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Herskovits</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Memorandum on the study of acculturation</article-title><source>Am Anthropol</source><year>1936</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>152</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1525/aa.1936.38.1.02a00330</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marin</surname><given-names>BV</given-names></name><name><surname>Tschann</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gomez</surnam